  <main class="seo-page"><section class="seo-hero"><p class="seo-kicker">Psychology and counselling</p><h1>Talk-based support for the concerns you carry</h1>
<div class="seo-answer"><strong>Direct answer:</strong> Mind Grace Neuropsychiatric Clinic in Greater Noida offers counselling and psychotherapy pathways for individuals, couples, families, and young people &mdash; a space to understand patterns, practise skills, and consider changes at your own pace.</div><p class="seo-lead">Counselling and psychotherapy offer a space to understand patterns, practise skills, and consider changes in a way that respects your pace and context.</p><div class="seo-actions"><a class="btn" href="/book">Request support</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/services/#counseling">See current services</a></div></section><section class="seo-section"><h2>Possible areas of support</h2><div class="seo-grid"><article class="seo-card"><h3>Individual work</h3><p>Support may focus on anxiety, low mood, stress, confidence, grief, trauma, sleep, or coping with change.</p></article><article class="seo-card"><h3>Relationships and family</h3><p>Family counselling, couples counselling, parenting support, and communication work may be considered where appropriate.</p></article><article class="seo-card"><h3>Skills and approaches</h3><p>Depending on the clinician and concern, work may include CBT-informed, behavioural, supportive, mindfulness, or other approaches.</p></article></div><div class="seo-note"><strong>Availability note:</strong> A specific therapist, modality, session format, or outcome is not guaranteed. The clinic will discuss suitability before care begins.</div></section><section class="seo-section"><h2>Find the right starting point</h2><p>Read about <a href="/assessments">assessments</a>, <a href="/teleconsultation">teleconsultation</a>, or <a href="/process">your first visit</a>.</p></section>    
